{"id":130742,"title":"Parallel sphere rendering","url":"https://digital.library.unt.edu/ark:/67531/metadc794439/?q=parallel volume rendering","final_url":"https://digital.library.unt.edu/ark:/67531/metadc794439/m2/1/high_res_d/90358.pdf","year":null,"kind":"link","source":"os:digital.library.unt.edu","doi":null,"arxiv":null,"sha256":"fa8a2fe4c171a0518878f13014af9875636bfd8ecd331be4cedf61c4e79a2add","ctype":"application/pdf","text_src":"url","fetched_at":1793305924.8419852,"text_chars":40868,"abstract":"Sphere rendering is an important method for visualizing molecular dynamics data. This paper presents a parallel divide-and-conquer algorithm that is almost 90 times faster than current graphics workstations. To render extremely large data sets and large images, the algorithm uses the MIMD features of the supercomputers to divide up the data, render independent partial images, and then finally composite the multiple partial images using an optimal method. The algorithm and performance results are presented for the CM-5 and the T3D.","file":null,"marks":["unofficial"],"links":["https://digital.library.unt.edu/ark:/67531/metadc794439/m2/1/high_res_d/90358.pdf","https://digital.library.unt.edu/ark:/67531/metadc794439/?q=parallel volume rendering","https://digital.library.unt.edu/ark:/67531/metadc794439/?q=volume rendering library","https://digital.library.unt.edu/ark:/67531/metadc794439/?q=load balancing volume rendering","https://digital.library.unt.edu/ark:/67531/metadc794439/?q=distributed shared virtual memory volume rendering","https://digital.library.unt.edu/ark:/67531/metadc794439/?q=3d table animation volume rendering","https://digital.library.unt.edu/ark:/67531/metadc794439/?q=parallel direct compositing","https://digital.library.unt.edu/ark:/67531/metadc794439/?q=parallel image compositing","https://digital.library.unt.edu/ark:/67531/metadc794439/?q=silhouette image volume rendering"],"cited_by":[{"path":"3264-binary-swap-compositing.md","name":"Binary Swap Compositing","k":9},{"path":"6889-sort-last-parallel-rendering.md","name":"Sort-last Parallel Rendering","k":9}]}